  "slug": "4-ingredient-teriyaki-sauce",
  "name": "4-Ingredient Teriyaki Sauce",
  "recipe_type": "side",
  "brief_description": "All you need to whip up this quick and easy, versatile 4-ingredient teriyaki sauce is brown sugar, soy sauce, apple cider vinegar, and H2O!",
  "cuisine": null,
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Heat a saucepan over medium heat. Add soy sauce, water, and vinegar; cook until heated through, 1 to 2 minutes. Stir in brown sugar, mustard, garlic powder, and ginger; cook until dissolved, about 2 minutes. Remove from heat; let stand until slightly thickened, 3 to 5 minutes."
    }
  ],
